cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use abfunnel, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "abfunnel: Design, Check and Analyse Digital Marketing Experiments and Funnels"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-02
authors:
  - family-names: "Sánchez-Núñez"
    given-names: "Pablo"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7845-9506"
url: "https://pablosancheznunez.com/abfunnel/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/pablosancheznunez/abfunnel"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - digital marketing
  - online experiments
  - A/B testing
  - conversion funnels
  - sample ratio mismatch
  - pre-registration
  - R
abstract: >-
  An R package that supports online controlled experiments and conversion
  funnels in digital marketing research, from sample size planning and
  pre-registration to sample ratio checks, effect estimates with confidence
  intervals and a self-contained report.
